# feishu-bot/.dockerignore
#
# NOTE: with `context: .` + `dockerfile: feishu-bot/Dockerfile`, Docker reads the
# .dockerignore at the *context root*, so this file documents intent and applies
# to `docker build -f feishu-bot/Dockerfile feishu-bot` style contexts. The
# Dockerfile additionally removes stray caches after COPY so the image stays
# clean either way.
.venv
__pycache__
*.pyc
.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache
.sdk-inspect/
tests
*.md
.env
.env.*
